abstract: "Single-file zero-build 3D browser physics game (index.html, Three.js + cannon-es) where players stack fast-food French fries, chicken nuggets (McNuggets), and burger patties into 12 sculptures or wind-gust high-tower challenges, bundled with an AI co-play coach Agent Skill and optional MCP guide."
